# Admin scroll / overflow lock

Before changing shell overflow, width, clear, gutters, or grids in `admin.css` / `Assets.php`, follow the full invariant in the monorepo rule:

`Sletci/.cursor/rules/prime-fleet-admin-width.mdc`

**Short form:** only `html` clips-X + scrolls-Y; `body`/app `overflow: visible`; bottom `::after` ~120px on OUR wrap; right pad 16px; never `clear:both` on table-tools; never restyle `#adminmenu*`; `#wpcontent` may be `sticky` under admin-bar (content column only); sync Assets.php.
